            {
                "entry_id": "e78435a6-6a90-3a95-9ef8-54519f29d876",
                "word": "hétéroromantique",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "1934ef2e-3ed7-4103-8f48-1d89754c3429",
                        "entry_id": "e78435a6-6a90-3a95-9ef8-54519f29d876",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "hétéroromantiques"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "610a3ad3-0654-3f2a-b794-6bdd69d05726",
                        "entry_id": "e78435a6-6a90-3a95-9ef8-54519f29d876",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui est attiré·e sentimentalement par les personnes d’un ou plusieurs genres opposés au sien."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "LGBTQ"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cf9e97a4-b393-4948-9d29-93946af1ae6d",
                                "sense_id": "610a3ad3-0654-3f2a-b794-6bdd69d05726",
                                "text": "Il me faudra je le sais, du monde toute la volonté\nPour ces désirs ardents, me sacrifier\nAfin de connaître l'enfantement tant désiré\nSuis-je hétéroromantique ou biromantique ?\nHomoromantique ou juste agnostique ?\nMes amies pensent que je suis une pan-romantique."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "30166a5d-b84d-43d8-8763-932c4e9aff96",
                        "source_entry_id": "e78435a6-6a90-3a95-9ef8-54519f29d876",
                        "source_sense_id": "610a3ad3-0654-3f2a-b794-6bdd69d05726",
                        "target_lang_word": "heteroromantic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "heteroromantic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d08206c5-a6ce-3016-a3c7-c5af0f17b8d6",
                                        "entry_id": "cb8c2b59-bd99-35d4-9cc7-e188f8614784",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Romantically attracted to those of the opposite gender."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9962abfb-08d3-4232-b57e-eb8f2463d788",
                                                "sense_id": "d08206c5-a6ce-3016-a3c7-c5af0f17b8d6",
                                                "text": "Often, however, asexual people will also identify with a particular sexual orientation, minus the sexual aspect, and may define themselves as heteroromantic, homoromantic, biromantic, transromantic or panromantic."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f06dc88e-a122-44ce-a408-226e03ec5070",
                                                "sense_id": "d08206c5-a6ce-3016-a3c7-c5af0f17b8d6",
                                                "text": "It does not address other kinds of sexuality such as demisexual (sexual attraction is experienced only when accompanied by a strong emotional attraction), pansexual (attraction across all gender identities and biological sexes. Think “gender blind”), and the romantics (Homoromantic/heteroromantic/aromantic making attraction experienced romantically rather than sexually) among others."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8bd223fa-2983-4bcb-92fc-ab8e1c3a7bdf",
                                                "sense_id": "d08206c5-a6ce-3016-a3c7-c5af0f17b8d6",
                                                "text": "Thus, you can be asexual and biromantic (romantically attracted to men and women), panromantic (romantically attracted to any gender identity), homoromantic (romantically attracted to members of the same sex), or heteroromantic (romantically attracted to members of the opposite sex). Some aces are asexual and aromantic, meaning they enjoy platonic friendships, but don’t experience romantic attraction."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac0c826b-e510-456e-825b-cd666ff637d6",
                                                "sense_id": "d08206c5-a6ce-3016-a3c7-c5af0f17b8d6",
                                                "text": "There are different types of ‘aces’, with asexuals being heteroromantic (romantically attracted to the opposite sex); homoromantic (to the same sex); biromantic (to both sexes); panromantic (to both sexes and transsexuals); or aromantic (experiencing little or no romantic attraction to anyone)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e54eec92-1b6e-4714-8840-8a6b059cc6fb",
                        "source_entry_id": "e78435a6-6a90-3a95-9ef8-54519f29d876",
                        "source_sense_id": "610a3ad3-0654-3f2a-b794-6bdd69d05726",
                        "target_lang_word": "heterorromántico",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "heterorromántico",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ae841a61-7949-307e-97e1-f3c6af29d579",
                                        "entry_id": "7fe4ccfe-e8df-3140-8147-9f478a130339",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "(persona) Que siente atracción romántica solo hacia los individuos del sexo o género opuesto."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "heterorromántico",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "85944a0f-996e-322f-840d-efedf36665c5",
                                        "entry_id": "2bd11a4f-cbb2-313b-93a1-0efc636d956c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relativo al romance entre personas de distinto sexo o género."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e4055cd7-95c7-4292-93b3-138d10e625f5",
                                                "sense_id": "85944a0f-996e-322f-840d-efedf36665c5",
                                                "text": "Los asexuales heterorrománticos buscan relaciones románticas por una variedad de razones, incluyendo la compañía, el afecto y la intimidad, pero no sienten necesariamente atracción sexual hacia sus compañeros sentimentales."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
